            "Format each permutation into one string and write it without per-line std::endl flushing.",
            "Use OpenMP dynamic work sharing over distinct first-byte prefixes and a bounded, ordered queue per prefix; retain a serial fallback when useful parallelism is unavailable."
          ]
        },
